BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Amavasya — Ashvina / अमावस्या — आश्व
 िन
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTSTAMP:20261103T043905Z
UID:amavasya-2026-11-09@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:purnima-amavasya\,ancestral
DESCRIPTION:Why: when the moon is dark\, turn attention to those who came 
 before.\n\nStory: Amavasya is the new-moon tithi — traditionally linked 
 with ancestral remembrance (pitru) and quieter household rites.\nSource: G
 aruda Purana ancestral strands\; panchanga practice\nWhy: when the moon is
  dark\, turn attention to those who came before.\nModern angle: Scheduled 
 grief/remembrance days aid mourning culture\; cultural/psychological.\nEvi
 dence: Cultural/psychological\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharm
 asetu/prototype/reasoning.html#shraddha-remembrance\nLocation basis: New D
 elhi. City-specific timing coming later.\n\n—\nअमावस्या 
 — आश्विन\nअमावस्या अमावस्या 
 तिथि — पितृ स्मरण और शांत गृ
 ह कर्मों से जुड़ी।\nकारण: चंद
 ्र के अँधेरे में पूर्वजों की
  ओर ध्यान।
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/calendar.html#c84
 5425ac6efc2ee
END:VEVENT
