BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pitru Paksha begins / पितृ पक्ष आरंभ
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270916
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270917
DTSTAMP:20261103T043905Z
UID:pitru_paksha_start-2027-09-16@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:ancestral\,festivals
DESCRIPTION:Why: set aside days so remembrance is not left to chance — f
 ood\, water and name offered with care.\n\nStory: Pitru Paksha opens after
  Bhadrapada Purnima — a fortnight of shraddha for ancestors\, closing on
  Sarvapitri Amavasya.\nSource: Garuda Purana\; Shraddha Kalpa traditions\n
 Why: set aside days so remembrance is not left to chance — food\, water 
 and name offered with care.\nModern angle: Structured mourning and remembr
 ance support grief processing\; cultural/psychological (see Worden / conti
 nuing-bonds literature).\nEvidence: Plausible\nLink: https://pubmed.ncbi.n
 lm.nih.gov/20680363/\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/pro
 totype/reasoning.html#shraddha-remembrance\nLocation basis: New Delhi. Cit
 y-specific timing coming later.\n\n—\nपितृ पक्ष आर
 ंभ\nपितृ पक्ष भाद्रपद पूर्णि
 मा के बाद आरंभ — पूर्वजों के 
 श्राद्ध का पक्ष\, सर्वपित्नी
  अमावस्या पर समाप्त।\nकारण: स
 ्मरण संयोग पर न छूटे — अन्न\, 
 जल और नाम सावधानी से अर्पित।
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/calendar.html#65b
 dddf8f1d44a71
END:VEVENT
